{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>\n\n</p>\n<p>此前，用户發表私密朋友圈需要手動選擇「私密」，過程較為繁瑣。該功能相當於是一個私密朋友圈的快速發表入口。</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://static.cnbetacdn.com/article/2026/0909/283151860fe08ee.jpg\"/>\n</p>\n<p>對此，騰訊客服回應稱：私密朋友圈是微信近期推出的新功能，目前已在iOS和Android客户端進行灰度測試，其他機型正在適配中。</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://static.cnbetacdn.com/article/2026/0909/8113646b35598be.jpg\"/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://static.cnbetacdn.com/article/2026/0909/edb80691e7ca6d4.png\"/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://static.cnbetacdn.com/article/2026/0909/283151860fe08ee.jpg\"/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://static.cnbetacdn.com/article/2026/0909/8113646b35598be.jpg\"/>\n</p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-09T04:39:22.419459+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":116,"images":5,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"none"}}